ばさんではないよ。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/04/06/8951774/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにズーラシア満喫したけど\n動物ってかわいいねえ、\nすごく楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもいちご狩りに行くの\n楽しみにしてたから\nやっぱり行きたいなあーって思ってて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両親が行くって言うので\n便乗して来たよ( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/04/06/8951774/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両親と\nのんびり一泊二日できて\n幸せだったよ～( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私の春の思い出でした！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握ではてぃーちゃんも\n急遽同じになって\nスイカレーン( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2017/04/06/8951774/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日の楽屋の席も\nスイカ5人で座ってたから\nにゃーとゆっちゃんも\nうちらのレーン来ればいいのに～と\n話していました(*'ω'*)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに前の日のご飯も\nスイカとまちゅと琴子で\nいつものメンバーだったよ～(*'ω'*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、\nインフルエンサーの若ポジに入ってました！\n気づいた人は少ないかしら...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":